    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. it just feels like a cycle that never ends. even if i talk to someone, i still wake up tomorrow and i'm still this same exhausted person, facing the same heavy stuff. it's like there's no actual escape from how heavy this is. what if there just isn't a version of my life where i don't feel this way?",
