      "content": "When you feel trapped in a repeating cycle, the idea that things could fundamentally change can feel remote. However, therapy and consistent support are designed not just to offer temporary relief, but to help create lasting patterns of change. Even small shifts in how you approach daily challenges can begin to ease that heavy feeling over time. Please keep the smallest door of hope open and consider exploring resources that specialize in long-term well-being.",
      "source": "target",
